  fhir:PlanDefinition.description [ fhir:value "Example formulary (selection layer, §3 of the Selection Layer page). Lists the three mFOLFOX6 specifications the NZ SACT Regimen Library publishes for colorectal cancer and maps each to its HemOnc basis. Restriction: the other 19 HemOnc mFOLFOX6 variants are not offered. Extension: two entries have no HemOnc variant and are expressed as a parameter set and a derived protocol respectively."] ;
